This is the BepInEx client plugin from the "Hardline Leaderboard" / HardRank
project, which reports match results to a leaderboard backend. It's used
here to report to HardRankBot (see the sibling HardRankBot/ project) instead
of the original hosted HardRank site.

Changes from the original:
  - The `ApiKey` config description now points players at the /hostkey
    Discord command (HardRankBot's self-service per-host key system)
    instead of a website profile page, since there is no website here.
  - The .csproj's game-DLL reference paths were rewritten for a Windows
    Steam install (`Project Hardline_Data\Managed\...`) instead of the
    original's Mac `.app` bundle paths
    (`Project Hardline.app/Contents/Resources/Data/Managed`). Building on
    Mac needs those paths restored — see HardlineLeaderboard.csproj.

No other logic was changed — match reporting, disconnect tracking, and the
JSON payload format are all unchanged from the original.
